    "independence": "Two read-only frozen scope reviews; unchanged input hashes. Root implementation only.",
    "decision": "Restore without writes; serialize baseline-checked saves with Web Locks; preserve recovery drafts and invalid originals; prepare all geometry before commit; fixed Solid legacy migration; separate view state from design; explicit battery target; session undo/redo with named JSON snapshots; split lazy print payload and deduplicate byte-identical geometry; complete offline HTML.",
    "agreement": true,
    "disagreements": [],
    "disposition": "All existing HIGH/MEDIUM defects are implementation acceptance requirements, including newly identified palette data loss. No unresolved objection to this bounded route. Named JSON snapshots reuse file export; no additional mutable saved-design collection.",
    "implementation_status": "not_started",
    "hardware_geometry_changes": false
  },
